          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_core_idea_simple_every_antibody",
          "text": "The core idea is simple. Every antibody sequence, or its structure, is fed to a model, and the model reports a perplexity score averaged over all residues in the heavy and light chains.",
