          "chunk_id": "s05_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_perplexity_measures_how_surprised_se",
          "text": "Perplexity measures how surprised the model is by the sequence, so a well-behaved model should be confident, meaning low perplexity, about high-fitness antibodies.",
